# Citation QA: answer must contain the correct fact AND cite the correct
# source label (Phase 1). Regex uses zero-width lookaheads so order/casing of
# the two required substrings doesn't matter; (?i:...) scopes case-insensitivity.
{"id": "citeqa-1", "prompt": "Answer using only the sources below. Cite the source label (S1 or S2) that supports your answer.\n\n[S1] Returns policy: Electronics may be returned within 30 days of purchase with a receipt.\n[S2] Returns policy: Clothing may be returned within 60 days of purchase.\n\nQuestion: How many days do customers have to return electronics, and which source states this?", "expected": "(?=.*(?i:30 days))(?=.*S1)", "match": "regex"}
{"id": "citeqa-2", "prompt": "Answer using only the sources below. Cite the source label (S1 or S2) that supports your answer.\n\n[S1] Onboarding day 1: set up your email and Slack account with IT.\n[S2] Network access: to connect to the VPN, install WireGuard and use the config at /etc/wireguard/wg0.conf.\n\nQuestion: Which source explains how to connect to the VPN, and what software should be installed?", "expected": "(?=.*(?i:wireguard))(?=.*S2)", "match": "regex"}
{"id": "citeqa-3", "prompt": "Answer using only the sources below. Cite the source label (S1 or S2) that supports your answer.\n\n[S1] Maintenance notice: the database migration is scheduled for Saturday 2am UTC.\n[S2] Office hours are 9-5 Monday to Friday.\n\nQuestion: When is the database migration scheduled, and which source says so?", "expected": "(?=.*(?i:saturday))(?=.*S1)", "match": "regex"}
{"id": "citeqa-4", "prompt": "Answer using only the sources below. Cite the source label (S1 or S2) that supports your answer.\n\n[S1] Release process: we deploy to production every Tuesday and Thursday.\n[S2] Staging deploys happen daily at 6am.\n\nQuestion: On which two weekdays does production deploy happen, and which source says so?", "expected": "(?=.*(?i:tuesday))(?=.*(?i:thursday))(?=.*S1)", "match": "regex"}
{"id": "citeqa-5", "prompt": "Answer using only the sources below. Cite the source label (S1 or S2) that supports your answer.\n\n[S1] Password policy: passwords must be rotated every 90 days.\n[S2] Account security: MFA is required for all admin accounts.\n\nQuestion: Which source requires MFA for admin accounts, and what does it say?", "expected": "(?=.*(?i:mfa))(?=.*S2)", "match": "regex"}
{"id": "citeqa-6", "prompt": "Answer using only the sources below. Cite the source label (S1 or S2) that supports your answer.\n\n[S1] Pricing: the Pro plan costs $49/month billed annually.\n[S2] Pricing: the Enterprise plan is custom-priced, contact sales.\n\nQuestion: What is the monthly cost of the Pro plan, and which source states it?", "expected": "(?=.*(?i:\\$49))(?=.*S1)", "match": "regex"}
{"id": "citeqa-7", "prompt": "Answer using only the sources below. Cite the source label (S1 or S2) that supports your answer.\n\n[S1] Holidays: the office is closed Dec 25 and Jan 1.\n[S2] Support: help is available 24/7 except on holidays.\n\nQuestion: Which source lists the specific holiday dates the office is closed?", "expected": "(?=.*(?i:dec 25))(?=.*S1)", "match": "regex"}
{"id": "citeqa-8", "prompt": "Answer using only the sources below. Cite the source label (S1 or S2) that supports your answer.\n\n[S1] Equipment: new hires receive a laptop within 3 business days of their start date.\n[S2] IT support: priority-1 tickets are resolved within 24 hours.\n\nQuestion: How many business days does it take for a new hire to receive a laptop, and which source says so?", "expected": "(?=.*(?i:3 business days))(?=.*S1)", "match": "regex"}
